      }
    ],
    "executable": true,
    "explanation": "The caregiver successfully obtained and completed hematology-directed CBC testing, received现场 review, and could repeat the home medication, monitoring, urgent-care, and repeat-CBC plan. Closure remained premature because chronic/psychiatric medication reconciliation and a privacy-sensitive plan for communicating adherence barriers were not completed.",
