          "quote": "去血液科门诊诊室或日间病房找医生看一眼"
        },
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00286",
          "explanation": "The doctor set a near-term repeat-CBC deadline.",
          "quote": "最晚不要超过后天上午"
